<%- include('../sidenavs/user') %>
    <main>
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
                background: #ffffff;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .dashboard-container {
                padding: 30px 20px;
                max-width: 1400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                margin-top: -50px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .welcome-section {
                text-align: center;
                margin-bottom: 40px;
            }

            .welcome-title {
                color: #143f4c;
                font-size: 2.4em;
                margin-bottom: 15px;
            }

            .welcome-description {
                color: #555;
                font-size: 1.1em;
                line-height: 1.6;
                max-width: 700px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }

            .content-wrapper {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 40px;
                margin-top: 20px;

            }

            .features-section,
            .impact-section {
                background: #ffffff;
                padding: 25px;
                border-radius: 12px;

            }

            .section-title {
                color: #143f4c;
                font-size: 1.8em;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: -20px;
            }

            .features-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .feature-card {
                background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f1f1f1);
                padding: 20px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            }

            .feature-card:hover {
                transform: translateY(-5px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            }

            .feature-card h4 {
                color: #0077cc;
                font-size: 1.2em;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }

            .feature-card p {
                color: #555;
                font-size: 0.95em;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            .impact-card {
                background: #eaf6f9;
                padding: 25px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                text-align: center;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            }

            .impact-card p {
                color: #333;
                font-size: 1em;
                line-height: 1.6;
                margin: 0;
            }

            @media (max-width: 768px) {
                .content-wrapper {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <div class="dashboard-container">
            <div class="welcome-section">
                <h2 class="welcome-title">Welcome to Imaging Workflow System</h2>
                <p class="welcome-description">
                    This system ensures efficient, transparent, and seamless handling of projects, empowering
                    stakeholders while preserving the museum's invaluable collection.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-wrapper">
                <div class="features-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">✨ Features of the System</h3>
                    <div class="features-grid"
                        style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <h4>📌 Centralized Request Platform</h4>
                            <p>All projects are managed centrally, ensuring clarity, consistency, and ease of
                                use.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <h4>🎯 Customizable Requests</h4>
                            <p>Specify imaging needs—resolution, format, annotations, or focus areas, tailored to your
                                request.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <h4>🔍 Transparent Workflow</h4>
                            <p>Track every request from submission to fulfilment with real-time project status updates.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="features-grid"
                        style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); max-width: 700px; margin: 20px auto 0;">
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <h4>⏱️ Prioritization & Scheduling</h4>
                            <p>Efficiently allocate resources based on urgency, complexity, and potential impact.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <h4>🔐 Secure Data Management</h4>
                            <p>Ensure confidentiality and secure storage of user data and all imaging outputs.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="impact-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">🌍 Impact of Our Work</h3>
                    <div class="impact-card">
                        <p>By digitizing and sharing our collection, we bridge the gap between the natural world and
                            science, promoting biodiversity awareness.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- <a href="/form">Form</a>
    <a href="/auth/logout">Logout</a> -->
    </main>